/**
 * Price list — FODEL's published tariff, which the prototype omitted entirely
 * (its Sellers page ended at "Árlista kérése" → a generic contact form).
 *
 * Figures are exactly those on fodel.hu/arlista: €69 / €129 / €179, €25 per
 * language, €15 and €25 per month for highlighting, €36 video, €30 retro
 * photos, €25 renewal. All prices include 21% Dutch VAT.
